title: "A fixed shear for homogeneous cubic bent functions in every even dimension at least six"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "An explicit quadratic permutation for every m at least three, with one prescribed shear that produces a homogeneous cubic bent function for every homogeneous cubic offset. This strengthens the existence statement in Polujan–Pott Open Problem 3.10; earlier twelve-variable seeds and their product extension are credited."
